DISCOVERY DEMAND D — GAL FINANCIAL CONFLICTS & BIAS

CASE: 1FDV-23-0001009
TO: Scot Stuart Brower, Esq. (Mother's Counsel)

DEFENDANT DEMANDS complete production of:

1. Identity of who is paying the GAL (mother, court appointment, other)
2. All fee agreements between GAL and mother
3. All communications about payment/compensation
4. All prior relationships between GAL and mother or mother's counsel
5. All GAL matters assigned by Judge Nasso in the past 5 years
6. Total fees paid to this GAL by all parties in mother's case area
7. GAL's conflict of interest disclosure (if any)

RESPONSE DUE: 14 calendar days from service
FORMAT: Native electronic file format

STATUTORY BASIS: HRS §571-46(b) mandates GAL independence. Financial dependence on the paying party creates per se bias and grounds for removal and retrial.
